Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.61,0:00:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, but so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.79,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.65,0:01:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.89,0:01:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.81,0:01:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.94,0:01:53.94,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,780)\blur0.7\bord1.4\c&H4C4C4C&\3c&H4C4C4C&}Alubarna Palace
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.94,0:01:53.94,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,780)\blur0.7\bord0\c&HFAFAFA&\4a&HFF&}Alubarna Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.33,0:01:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Orchaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrible news! It's the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.03,0:01:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happened to his majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.69,0:01:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.73,0:01:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.79,0:02:04.92,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,700)\blur0.6\bord1.9\fsp-2\c&H242422&\3c&H242422&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(755,800,\1a&H00&)\t(5430,5475,\1a&HFF&)}Rebellion
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.79,0:02:04.92,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,700)\blur0.6\bord0\fsp-2\c&HF9F9F9&\4a&HFF&}Rebellion
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.15,0:02:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you searched everywhere? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.71,0:02:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We searched the palace, the\Ngarden, and the storehouses!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he have slipped away\Nin the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.71,0:02:11.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king's security was airtight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could\Nhave gotten past us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.81,0:02:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.72,0:02:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would the king hide\Nhimself just before the battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Search!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check outside the palace and in the town!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.75,0:02:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only Pell were here instead of\Non reconnaissance and rain base,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he excels at tracking people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could have happened to his majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to act recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Chaka, we have news\Nof the King! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.25,0:02:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you found him? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.23,0:02:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's in Nanohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.41,0:02:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The information is certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good. That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.63,0:02:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sir, you see, it's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.33,0:02:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why now, all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.67,0:03:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he fallen as far as he can?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so suspicious, Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would he do something this crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know his majesty's\Ncharacter too well for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would never betray us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what all you old people say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't come all the\Nway to you, but with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just to please the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.15,0:03:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebels were over a\Nhundred thousand strong now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there have been casualties, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.67,0:03:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.77,0:04:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little rain and these suspicions\Nwill vanish like fog. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.11,0:04:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.15,0:04:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The canal's been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.03,0:04:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we can't bring water to the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hasn't rained for over a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aramalu is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so suspicious, Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to suspect you,\Nbut people are dying of thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.43,0:04:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're not using\Nit, but you do have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must wait for natural rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To use dance powder is\Nto summon misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a small amount should be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.13,0:04:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebellion might stop even\Nif there's just a little rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.27,0:04:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would only result in\Nan even greater calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand your desperation, but\Nit's not as easy as you think, Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.55,0:05:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand to watch\Ntowns dry up anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed a bit\Nfrom the old days, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.99,0:05:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I swear, I'll come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.69,0:05:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I do, I'm going to\Ntake your reign from you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.96,0:05:38.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,830)\blur0.7\bord1.3\c&H4C4C4C&\3c&H4C4C4C&}Nanohana
Dialogue: 2,0:05:33.96,0:05:38.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,830)\blur0.7\bord0\4a&HFF&}Nanohana
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jai, you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.53,0:05:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard me right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.89,0:05:42.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come here to apologize to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was none other than I, the ruler of\NAlabasta, who stole all this country's reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lord, surely you must be\Njoking with us. You must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.69,0:05:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:06:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew how desperate things were\Nand yet you only helped yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No decent ruler would be so selfish if\Nhe knew his own people were in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you, a common peasant, speak\Ndisrespectfully to your lord and master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I needn't\Njustify my actions to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.55,0:06:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came to Nanohana to\Napologize for what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What more do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother died in Yuba thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.85,0:06:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't come all the way to\Nthis town just to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.27,0:06:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is another reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.27,0:06:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you may know, Dance Powder is\Noutlawed by the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.43,0:06:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If word got out that\Nit had been used here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the marines would certainly take\Naction and destroy this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.19,0:06:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.33,0:06:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may also remember that\Nlarge amounts of dance powder
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were found being smuggled out\Nof this town two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is necessary to eliminate\Nall traces of that incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.11,0:06:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.29,0:06:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.57,0:07:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is only one way to erase\Nthis incident from our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must obliterate Nanohana\Nand everyone in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to die because\Nyou're going to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, King!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it was all your fault after all! You...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you stole the rain and killed the towns!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get even with you\Nfor what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make you pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.47,0:07:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apple, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.53,0:07:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men, burn it to the ground\Nand leave no one alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, it's Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:02.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:04.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.99,0:08:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I had made that\Nclear. Shut up! Just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.09,0:08:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what you're doing\Nto the people who believed in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is an insult.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, I am the one\Nwho's been using dance powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so angry? Koza?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.43,0:08:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely even you, behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm trying to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.95,0:08:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cold, heartless bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.17,0:08:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know how these people\Nfelt as they died of thirst?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They felt no hatred or anger towards you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't the king's fault this is\Nhappening to us, he's a great leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those were the words on their lips as\Nthey died, they never lost faith in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, you come here and apologize,\Nand what happens to their faith?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.41,0:08:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least have the decency to\Nlie and say you're innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, kids, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:17.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't we fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the kingdom, because everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wanted to know if you were innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.07,0:09:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A giant ship's about to crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.93,0:10:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of ship is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only over!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.83,0:10:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the big finale, that was sure easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have we ever done\Nanything that wasn't easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We pulled it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.71,0:10:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's light the\Nfires and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.09,0:11:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels so good to get back into gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.73,0:11:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, say something, Koza! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.33,0:11:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, the royal army has disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.87,0:11:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I the kingliest king you ever\Nsaw back there, or was I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.77,0:11:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you were the\Ngreatest, Mr. Barclay, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.91,0:11:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop those fires!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.27,0:11:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Royal Army started\Nthe fires, then ran off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.76,0:11:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to put them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all we have to do is meet up with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two outside town.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.71,0:11:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alabarna's the grand climax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.19,0:11:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know my favorite word is vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love that word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.15,0:11:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king's prospects of staying\Nking are exceedingly vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.39,0:11:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The operation is a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.07,0:11:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Moochie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's west of town, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.29,0:11:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toubon Clay, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.65,0:12:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? The king turned\Ninto a weird ballerina.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use. We can't stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.21,0:12:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.11,0:12:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad everyone's been\Ntricked i have to tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a naughty boy how\Nmuch do you think he knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.25,0:12:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That imbecile he had to\Nget careless and screw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.31,0:12:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.51,0:12:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you'd stay\Nquiet if we asked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.09,0:12:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need more water!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my water!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you pay for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not now, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The town's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put out the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.41,0:12:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just burning too quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should escape while we still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.27,0:12:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet, Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the type to just\Ngive in and die like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, take Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.89,0:12:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid, say something. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.95,0:13:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even children aren't safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.81,0:13:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.73,0:13:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try and talk, kid. I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's been tricked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.20,0:13:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.07,0:13:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country must die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contact all of our units.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.41,0:13:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be our final battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, all right, but we still\Ndon't have enough weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.53,0:13:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we have plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you know that ship that\Njust crashed into town?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As fate would have it,\Nit's an armory ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's full of weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.13,0:13:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.79,0:13:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,divine guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.11,0:13:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.02,0:13:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some little pipsqueak saw me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me, so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now all that remains is for Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.45,0:13:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forest Team to do its thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.51,0:14:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fatty and that old hag know\Nhow to get things done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.39,0:14:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catching the king will\Nbe a snap, you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, joy! I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.87,0:14:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me, rebel army!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Alabasta of old is dead now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.53,0:14:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be our ultimate battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.59,0:14:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We go now to capture the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Onward!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Alubarna!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.97,0:14:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The king must play!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll build a new country!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.07,0:14:32.32,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,780)\blur0.7\bord1.3\fscx90\fscy90\c&H4C4C4C&\3c&H4C4C4C&}Meanwhile, at Alubarna Palace
Dialogue: 2,0:14:30.07,0:14:32.32,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,780)\blur0.7\bord0\fscx90\fscy90\c&HFDFDFB&\4a&HFF&}Meanwhile, at Alubarna Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.23,0:14:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Cobra would never do\Nanything as mad as that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.33,0:14:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be a mistake! It's\Ntrue! And what's more,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the timing between his\Ndisappearance from the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,palace and his appearance\Nat Nanohana fits perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.79,0:14:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuses are useless now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.55,0:14:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,News of the Nanohana incident\Nhas spread throughout
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.91,0:14:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alabasta and rebel soldiers\Neverywhere are responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.32,0:14:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,citizens who once had faith in the king\Nare now taking up arms against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.61,0:14:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on their way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:15:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire kingdom is\Nrising up in rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.69,0:15:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lord, please command us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you decide, we will obey you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the king's words from\Nyesterday seem blurred now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.37,0:15:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I depend on?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.99,0:15:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to\Nperform our sworn duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are the royal guards of Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.31,0:15:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot let the kingdom crumble to\Nthe ground in the absence of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.71,0:15:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fulfill your oath!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defend the truth before you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must stop the rebel army!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.00,0:15:51.74,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,830)\blur0.7\bord1.3\c&H4C4C4C&\3c&H4C4C4C&}Rainbase
Dialogue: 2,0:15:47.00,0:15:51.74,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,830)\blur0.7\bord0\c&HFDFDFB&\4a&HFF&}Rainbase
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's horrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.35,0:16:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The operation you once participated\Nin is now reaching fruition
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.31,0:16:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you listen closely, I wager you\Ncan hear the howls of the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they all scream the same thing
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.03,0:16:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.23,0:16:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.85,0:16:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.45,0:16:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.27,0:16:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's heartbreaking, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their love for their kingdom\Nwill be what destroys it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.01,0:16:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't he hear what I said before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.99,0:16:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's definitely stupid, but that's\Nalso the reason he's our captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had to make so many moves\Nto be able to get to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.97,0:17:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sabotage to inflame the citizens,\Nmanipulating the royal army.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea why I'd go to\Nsuch lengths to destroy this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if I'd understand anything\Ninside your foul mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a pretty sharp tongue\Nfor a princess, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, what are you\Ntrying to do, Miss Wednesday?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.42,0:17:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.49,0:17:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.83,0:17:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just get to\NAlubarna east of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can get there before the Rebel\NArmy, I may be able to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.37,0:17:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never give up while there's a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.43,0:17:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow I'm going to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.17,0:17:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.37,0:18:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebel army is fast\Napproaching us, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.01,0:18:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, we must protect\NAlabasta with our own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not fear death!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight them with everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must stop the rebels!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take up intercept positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alibarna's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.31,0:18:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Koza?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.85,0:18:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.76,0:18:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.68,0:18:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.59,0:18:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, if we keep riding at this\Npace, we'll reach Alubarna by daybreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stop for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.97,0:18:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep riding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.93,0:18:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We attack at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.59,0:18:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can quit fooling around now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were just about to head to\NAlabana ourselves, Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.59,0:19:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd like to come with\Nus, Princess, then please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can try and save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.65,0:19:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The key...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,key to this cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.99,0:19:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Give it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.65,0:19:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.79,0:19:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.70,0:19:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A trapdoor!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.99,0:19:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be too long until the rebels\Nand the royal forces begin their battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.53,0:19:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the death even if you hurry to Alubarna\Nfrom here who knows if you'd make it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:20:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in time to stop the rebellion you need to\Nleave it once miss Wednesday will you do
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that or try and save your friends instead\Nit's your choice but if you choose the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.59,0:20:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,latter it doesn't help that I accidentally\Ndrop the key into the banana gators dead
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.05,0:20:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Banana gators!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.93,0:20:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.03,0:20:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out the window!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an alligator\Ngrowing out of that banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.73,0:20:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed,\Nthat's not the only one!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.21,0:20:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're in an aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we're not the fish food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:33.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.99,0:20:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot, look closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got bananas growing out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.21,0:20:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're weird gators, not weird bananas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.49,0:20:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now vv what happened a big banana\NKatorea just swallowed the key to your cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will it go down there and\Nmake them spit it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.09,0:20:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't stand a chance\Nthey're alpha predators!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.03,0:20:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the top of the food\Nchain they're so ferocious
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.07,0:21:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they even prey on sea\Nkings Luffy get near one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll devour you in one bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.77,0:21:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry you might have had the\Nkey if I hadn't accidentally
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.23,0:21:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.65,0:21:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now there's no telling which\None of my pets swallowed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.89,0:21:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.53,0:21:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, if we could just get out of here,\NI could handle those overgrown reptiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.27,0:21:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, you're really dumb, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.03,0:21:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't get out because\Nthe key got swallowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that, you stupid idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.51,0:21:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.47,0:21:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but we must be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time is of the essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.63,0:21:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and speaking of time, this room\Nwill be destroyed in exactly one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.61,0:21:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's served me well, but\Nit's no longer of any use.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.91,0:21:45.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon the waters of Rainbase's\Nlake will fill this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.17,0:21:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and unless there are\Nfish or one of my gators,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.75,0:21:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anyone left in here won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's either one\Nmillion innocent citizens,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.59,0:21:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or a mere four pirates who have no future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.57,0:21:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:22:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to be honest, the odds\Nare quite low for both.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you like gambling, Miss Wednesday,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.93,0:22:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because like they do at the tables upstairs,\Nyou're going to have to roll the dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.11,0:22:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I did with this country, which\Nwas simple thanks to all the fools here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People like those juvenile rebels,\Nand that old man digging in Yuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.01,0:22:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mean that\Ndried up old guy, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.27,0:22:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, even though\Neveryone else has abandoned it,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.15,0:22:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that old fool keeps pecking away every\Nday in an oasis that's long dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.07,0:22:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even as he's plagued by constant\Nsandstorms, he still digs away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.27,0:22:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know much about\Nsandstorms, do you, Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.73,0:22:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever wonder how one can hit\Na town perfectly every time?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.51,0:23:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dream of Yuba can't\Nbe beaten by lousy sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.03,0:23:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the water will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.53,0:23:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.25,0:23:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll dig out the sand as\Nmany times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.73,0:23:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.41,0:23:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As many times as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.99,0:23:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.47,0:23:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.37,0:23:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever it's worth, V .V.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.65,0:23:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dear, I have faith in you and his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.19,0:23:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a good man, a king who\Nwould never betray his country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.57,0:23:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.51,0:24:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The room is starting to flood. Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.21,0:24:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna drown if we\Ndon't do something really quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.95,0:24:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe, help, get us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.29,0:24:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to live a lot\Nlonger than just one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.97,0:24:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.33,0:24:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy, Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.75,0:24:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I not freak out\Nat a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all going to drown like\Nrats if we don't get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.57,0:24:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.77,0:24:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's either my kingdom or my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you've done is take, crocodile, so I\Nknow you wouldn't give me either choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.57,0:24:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I left for Alubarna, you'd\Nkill me before I ever reached it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.35,0:24:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only real choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.23,0:24:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only way to end this nightmare is\Nto take out the one who started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.59,0:24:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster, you don't know a thing, not\Nanything, about this country's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.45,0:24:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's history.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.21,0:24:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her way of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.21,0:25:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.81,0:25:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get us out! You can do it! I know you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.11,0:25:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.29,0:25:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you're finally starting to beg\Nfor your life, eh, Straw Hat Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.39,0:25:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no shame in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.91,0:25:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.13,0:25:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone is afraid of dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.25,0:25:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not begging!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.99,0:25:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just if I die, who else is\Ngonna be able to kick your ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.29,0:25:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't flatter yourself, small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.31,0:25:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a small fry who\Nthinks he's a big shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.49,0:25:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.13,0:25:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have had you killed if\Nyou had left for the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.39,0:25:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and of course I plan\Non doing the same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.03,0:26:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing is so gigantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.29,0:26:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.20,0:26:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You show that Katorea!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.35,0:26:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.45,0:26:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too big!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.53,0:26:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe, don't listen to this kook!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.01,0:26:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.92,0:26:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh, get us out, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.69,0:26:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She only has to be one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.39,0:26:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, look out the windows! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.31,0:26:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all waiting in line to eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.27,0:26:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we won't drown like rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.07,0:26:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but getting eaten by a ginormous\Nalligator isn't the way I want to go, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.91,0:26:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaku string!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.43,0:26:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing is fast! Stroke, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It jumped through those stone\Nstairs as if they were cardboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.91,0:26:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Vivi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.97,0:26:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.13,0:26:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.19,0:26:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.10,0:26:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.51,0:26:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, get up! Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.73,0:26:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.39,0:27:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna eat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.85,0:27:09.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.41,0:27:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.75,0:27:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.75,0:27:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.66,0:27:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.59,0:27:19.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.81,0:27:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a million, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.97,0:27:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, pal, is this thing working all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.91,0:27:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only used a transponder\Nsnail once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.57,0:27:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's working fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.83,0:27:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.74,0:27:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just talking to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.75,0:27:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.17,0:27:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and state your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.91,0:27:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.15,0:27:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've heard that voice before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.77,0:27:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there, you've reached the Crab Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.05,0:27:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Crab Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.91,0:27:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.09,0:27:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should, but in case it doesn't,\Nmaybe this will jog your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.49,0:27:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.07,0:27:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.35,0:27:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've reached the crap cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.03,0:27:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I take your order?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.87,0:27:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can quit fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.17,0:28:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A transponder snail?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.61,0:28:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.19,0:28:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never used a transponder snail\Nonce while on Little Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.23,0:28:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have four of the five Straw Hats\Ninside that cell based on what Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.19,0:28:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two showed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.23,0:28:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only one that's left is their pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.27,0:28:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they have other members\Nwe don't know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.51,0:28:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.65,0:28:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The voice was unmistakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.37,0:28:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.28,0:28:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.20,0:28:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't know about him,\Nso let's keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.57,0:28:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was in the cabin when Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.01,0:28:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two showed up, so they never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.61,0:28:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's our ace in the hole, so zip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.91,0:28:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.53,0:28:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow and Chopper didn't get captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.33,0:28:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.43,0:28:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.93,0:28:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind telling me who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.15,0:28:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.67,0:28:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.75,0:28:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just call me Mr. Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.63,0:28:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, Mr. Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.55,0:28:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind telling me something\Nelse, like where you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.17,0:28:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.59,0:28:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I did, you'd just come a\Nrunning and get rid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.61,0:29:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though I highly doubt you could\Nget rid of me, I'm not about to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.27,0:29:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.33,0:29:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never give up information easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.15,0:29:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike you just did, Mr. Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.17,0:29:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.08,0:29:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince, hurry! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.29,0:29:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't hurry up, we're all\Ngonna end up as Katorea bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.35,0:29:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.65,0:29:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the light out, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.17,0:29:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.08,0:29:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go rescue us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.00,0:29:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly allergic to alligators!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.11,0:29:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my loud-mouthed crew, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.21,0:29:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting me\Nknow they're with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.07,0:29:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is find you and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.39,0:29:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say no!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.89,0:29:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so tough now, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.39,0:29:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got him, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.47,0:29:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.51,0:29:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't be going anywhere in\Nthe condition we've put him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.11,0:29:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.02,0:29:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.41,0:29:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where are you? Speak up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.87,0:29:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at the front of the casino with\Nthe Katorea on top and rain base.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.25,0:29:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain dinners!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.75,0:29:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's not dead, he's gonna wish he was!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.23,0:29:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm gonna kill\Nhim next time I see him!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.65,0:29:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.71,0:30:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That poor guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.07,0:30:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.01,0:30:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we shouldn't leave the man waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.71,0:30:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.99,0:30:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The millions still don't know the\Nactual identity of their boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.27,0:30:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aside from the number agents, no\None knows who you and I truly are.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.25,0:30:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone thinks I'm a local\Nhero who also owns this casino.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.09,0:30:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing suspicious\Nabout a proprietor going
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.89,0:30:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to see what happened in\Nfront of this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.97,0:30:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our secret will be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.43,0:30:37.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.61,0:30:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.61,0:30:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still have time before this\Nroom fills completely with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.83,0:30:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going outside to help you know who.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.85,0:30:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.76,0:30:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he kicked\Nthe bucket, not that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.57,0:30:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can get him free, then\NI'm sure he can get us free.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.35,0:30:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Chopper's out there too,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.67,0:30:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we might actually have a\Nchance of getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.35,0:30:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.93,0:31:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.11,0:31:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you care for your friends that much,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.99,0:31:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Wednesday, you can\Njust die here with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.41,0:31:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which, thanks to the rising\Nwater and my hungry pets outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.55,0:31:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should occur very, very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.95,0:31:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse\Nme, I'm going to drag Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.69,0:31:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince back here to join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.17,0:31:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.21,0:31:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.51,0:31:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Mr. Crocodile, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.33,0:32:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard what's\Nhappening in Nanohana?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.09,0:32:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Yes. Tragic. The whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.35,0:32:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, the whole country is in an uproar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.41,0:32:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.73,0:32:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears the royal army and the rebel\Narmy, they're finally about to clash.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.21,0:32:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.15,0:32:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised the king does\Nlet pirates attack the cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.69,0:32:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always thought something like this might
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.67,0:32:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,happen if Cobra kept\Nletting this country suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.09,0:32:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.35,0:32:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.35,0:32:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile! I love him! Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.77,0:32:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A public appearance in the casino!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.45,0:32:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems you're as popular as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.73,0:32:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.73,0:32:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been there for me all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.75,0:32:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've never let me down,\Nso I do not let them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.21,0:32:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't let them die like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, she got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.71,0:33:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have just gone from bad to worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.85,0:33:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the rain is blowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.53,0:33:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't even have an hour left!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.89,0:33:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be lucky if we have 20 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.73,0:33:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.95,0:33:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.13,0:33:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get help, so just hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.49,0:33:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will get you out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.09,0:33:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to abandon\Nany of you, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.23,0:33:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back with help, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.11,0:33:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.02,0:33:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.43,0:33:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.23,0:33:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These were the remaining\Nmillions we had in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.17,0:33:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you include those that\NPell the Falcon took down,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.17,0:33:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every last one of them\Nhave been wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.83,0:33:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who did this? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.31,0:33:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.83,0:33:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was called Mr. Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.35,0:33:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought you idiots caught him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.65,0:34:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where the hell did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.01,0:34:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He headed toward the south part of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.73,0:34:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.81,0:34:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,South?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.72,0:34:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.79,0:34:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.70,0:34:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run all you want, but you can't escape me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.83,0:34:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.21,0:34:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.12,0:34:21.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always killed those\Nfoolish enough to cross me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.27,0:34:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's not a habit\NI'm quitting anytime soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.65,0:34:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that a crazy wipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.37,0:34:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.57,0:34:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it caused the bridge\Nto the casino to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.01,0:34:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole thing's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.39,0:34:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.30,0:34:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we're stranded in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.47,0:34:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can't gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.37,0:34:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how do we get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.27,0:34:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't there any boats?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.18,0:34:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.27,0:34:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bridge collapsed!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.01,0:34:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.37,0:34:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bridge is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.61,0:35:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I'm locked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.27,0:35:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do it to keep you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.29,0:35:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it to keep those Baroque\Nworks creeps out, gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.15,0:35:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one part of the plan you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.69,0:35:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other part is chopper running\Naround town is a decoy we're
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.29,0:35:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going to stop the civil war that's\Nabout to erupt in this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.95,0:35:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to hurry so?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.93,0:35:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you can tell me where our\Nfriends are, well, Princess?

